# rclone v1.75.1 (2026-09-04) is built with Go v1.26.6, golang.org/x/crypto
# v0.56.0 and golang.org/x/image v0.45.0, so the advisories that v1.75.0
# needed exceptions for are fixed and no longer listed here:
# CVE-2026-33818, CVE-2026-39821, CVE-2026-46600, CVE-2026-56853,
# CVE-2026-56858, CVE-2026-56859, CVE-2026-56860, CVE-2026-56862 (Go stdlib),
# CVE-2026-56854 (x/crypto) and CVE-2026-46603 (x/image).
#
# Still open: the rclone release embeds a vulnerable google.golang.org/grpc
# (GPRC-Go xDS servers denial of service via crash), fixed upstream in
# 1.82.2, 1.83.2 and 1.85.0-dev. No rclone build carries the fixed module
# yet. Track the next release at:
# https://github.com/rclone/rclone/releases
# Review and remove this exception by 2026-09-25.
# https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-84445
CVE-2026-84445
